        }
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Leave it to me!;......;Should I be taking this more seriously?",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Heh, good."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "But it's not the kind of thing you'll have to put so much effort into."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Now's not the time to clam up!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Are you waiting for me to say more?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "You could at least tell me what you're thinking, Doctor...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 3
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "No, that's okay!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "This isn't the kind of thing you need to be so solemn about."
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I'm going to call up Blaze and have her look after you. And for the little while until we meet up again, I need you to look after her too."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Me look after her? Have you seen me?;......;I can protect an elite operator? News to me.",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Ugh... I'm not talking about like in battle! I mean look after her psychology."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "You know Rhodes Island has to fight the Infected sometimes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Especially right now. Our cooperation with Lungmen has led to some friction."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Blaze is one of the elite operators we rely on for survival, yes, but her psychological state has an impact on her performance."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "It is because she is so resolutely committed to our mission that her encounters with the Infected have the potential to influence her emotions."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Go on, Doctor. Treat it as an opportunity to learn what makes her tick."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Show your appreciation for her. Thank her for saving you back there. She'll eat it up!"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Good idea!;......;Is that really necessary?",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I believe in you, Doctor! Go get 'em!"
    },
