    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Their main force is engaging our other teams!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "We will reach the target location ahead of Reunion and join the formation!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Tell them we need to eliminate all Reunion elements that have not joined up with their main force first."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Right. Got it!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Do what Superintendent Ch'en just said! Over and out!"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "How long has it been since we fought together like this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I wouldn't say we're 'fighting together' now. It's more like we're 'co-belligerents.' How did you get back here anyway?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "I've got my own motor pool, of course. How else do you think I saved Rhodes Island? Now what's got your panties in a twist? I can tell you're upset."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Hm. Let me think."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "You need to think about it! Look at you looking for reasons to be mad..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Oh, right. You went behind my back to save Rhodes Island. You could have told me in private."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Was that embarrassing for you? Or you just don't like being kept in the dark?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Both."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Wowee... since when are you so direct? My old Officer Ch'en would talk herself in circles for hours..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Eyes forward!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
